#: fedoraglass/gui/backend.py:2815
msgid "Steam and its games, video players (VLC, mpv, Videos, Celluloid, Clapper), RetroArch, Firefox, Brave, Discord, Slack, Zoom, Visual Studio Code, Obsidian, LibreOffice and Prism Launcher, and a few more. They draw their own solid windows, so glass behind them would only cost speed."
msgstr "Steam et ses jeux, les lecteurs vidéo (VLC, mpv, Vidéos, Celluloid, Clapper), RetroArch, Firefox, Brave, Discord, Slack, Zoom, Visual Studio Code, Obsidian, LibreOffice et Prism Launcher, et quelques autres. Ils dessinent leurs propres fenêtres opaques : du verre derrière elles ne ferait que ralentir l’ordinateur."

