#: fedoraglass/gui/qml/FedoraGlass/MotionCard.qml:564
msgid "Leaves Dash to Panel's own hover animation on."
msgstr "Laisse activée l’animation de survol propre à Dash to Panel."

#: fedoraglass/gui/qml/FedoraGlass/MotionCard.qml:565
